roficiency. Other countries in the following list will not be\nconsidered.\nExempt Countries\nAntigua and Barbuda\nAustralia\nBahamas, The\nBarbados\nBelize\nBotswana\nCanada\nDominica\nGhana\nGrenada\nGuyana\nIreland\nJamaica\nLesotho\nLiberia\nMauritius\nNamibia\nNew Zealand\nNigeria\nPhilippines\nSeychelles\nSierra Leone\nSingapore\nSolomon Islands\nSouth Africa\nSt. Kitts and Nevis\nSt. Lucia\nSt. Vincent and the Grenadines\nTrinidad and Tobago\nUnited Kingdom\nZambia\nZimbabwe\nUK Territories1\nUS Territories2\nAustralian Territories3\nNew Zealand Territories4\n1 UK Territories and Dependencies\nAnguilla\nAscension\nBermuda\nBritish Indian Ocean Territory\nBritish Virgin Islands\nCayman Islands\nChannel Islands\nFalkland Islands\nGibraltar\nIsle of Man\nMontserrat\nPitcairn\nSouth Georgia\nSouth Sandwich Islands\nSt. Helena\nTristan da Cunha\nTurks and Caicos Islands\n2 US Territories, Commonwealths, and Associated States\nAmerican Samoa\nGuam\nMarshall Islands\nMicronesia\nNorthern Mariana Islands\nPalau\nPuerto Rico\nUS Virgin Islands\nUS Minor Outlying Islands\n3 Australian Territories\nAshmore Island\nCartier Island\nChristmas Island\nCocos Islands\nCoral Sea Island\nNorfolk Island\n4 New Zealand Territories and Associate States\nCook Islands\nNiue\nTokelau\nRequest InformationTell us about yourself and stay connected with Michigan Tech.\nSchedule a VisitSee campus for yourself and discover what makes Tech special.\nApply NowTake the next step toward becoming a Michigan Tech Husky.\nGive to Michigan TechSupport the people, ideas, and research that move Tech forward.\nAdmissions\nUndergraduate Admissions\nGraduate Admissions\nGlobal Campus\nRequest Information\nSchedule a Visit\nApply\nVirtual Tours\nStudy and Live\nAcademics\nDegrees / Majors\nLibrary\nAthletics\nCampus and Beyond\nEvents Calendar\nRecreation\nCampus Info\nAbout Michigan Tech\nAccreditation\nCampus Map\nJobs at Michigan Tech\nNews\nSummer Youth Programs\nWebcams\nPolicies and Safety\nCampus